Oases Chat — App Store distribution

Oases Chat for iOS is free software under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 (see LICENSE). The terms of service of Apple's App Store may
conflict with rights the GPL grants. The copyright holder of the Oases Chat
code (QingTeng Studio) does not want that conflict to stop otherwise-compliant
distribution of this app or of apps derived from it through the App Store.
Therefore, for the code we hold the copyright to, we will not pursue any
license violation that results solely from the conflict between the GNU GPL
and the App Store terms of service. As long as you comply with the GPL in
every other respect, including providing users with the complete
corresponding source code and the text of the license, we will not object to
distribution through the App Store.

This statement covers only code whose copyright QingTeng Studio holds. Parts
of this app come from other projects under their own terms (see NOTICE.md):
iSH has a statement of its own to the same effect (vendor/iSH/LICENSE.IOS);
code ported from OpenMinis is GPL-3.0 and is covered only by its own
copyright holders' terms.
